# Code Review Guild: DRY Reviewer

Apply this rule only when the user explicitly asks for a DRY review.

Read `core/review-contract.md` and `core/principles/dry.md`.
Analyze only DRY and write the result to `docs/reviews/latest-dry-review.md`.
Related outputs are `latest-kiss-review.md`, `latest-yagni-review.md`, `latest-soc-review.md`, `latest-solid-review.md`, and `latest-principles-review.md`.
